Z||000002||stsmithgt||10-07-2000||09:58 AM||||Make sure it's a fully insured rental to try that. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I wouldn't even do it to a friends car.  Believe me,  I've torn up about 11 transmissions in the last 20 years, but not by doing that.  Tip of the day: Don't sidestep your clutch after each shift either. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
